
@apiUrl = http://localhost:3000
@devToken = dev-token
@seedRecipeId = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbb1

### Health
GET {{apiUrl}}/health

### Recipes - neprihlaseny request
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes

### Recipes - dev prihlaseni jako Adam Demo
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

### Recipes - filter podle textu
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes?query=chicken
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

### Recipes - filter podle meal type
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes?mealType=breakfast
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

### Recipe detail - seed recept
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes/{{seedRecipeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

### Recipe create
# @name createRecipe
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test omelette",
  "image": null,
  "prepTimeMin": 12,
  "portions": 1,
  "mealTypes": ["breakfast"],
  "steps": "Whisk eggs and cook on a pan.",
  "sourceUrl": null,
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "ingredientId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaa9",
      "displayName": "Eggs",
      "amountG": 110,
      "displayAmount": 2,
      "displayUnit": "pcs",
      "position": 0
    },
    {
      "ingredientId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaa15",
      "displayName": "Tomato",
      "amountG": 80,
      "displayAmount": 1,
      "displayUnit": "pc",
      "position": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Recipe detail - vytvoreny recept
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes/{{createRecipe.response.body.recipe.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}

### Recipe update - vytvoreny recept
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes/{{createRecipe.response.body.recipe.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test omelette updated",
  "prepTimeMin": 15,
  "mealTypes": ["breakfast", "snack"],
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "ingredientId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaa9",
      "displayName": "Eggs",
      "amountG": 165,
      "displayAmount": 3,
      "displayUnit": "pcs",
      "position": 0
    }
  ]
}

### Recipe import preview - zatim vraci 501
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes/import-url/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/recipe"
}

### Recipe delete - vytvoreny recept
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/v1/recipes/{{createRecipe.response.body.recipe.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{devToken}}
